t;&gt;즉시 알림 47종&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;이벤트를 받으면 바로" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="132" width="210" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-l-c0" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=1;exitY=0.1405;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="listeners" target="c0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e-c0-d" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.1405;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c0" target="save"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;예약 알림 5종&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;이벤트로 예약을 만들고&lt;br&gt;매분 배치가 시각이 되면" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="216" width="210" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-l-c1" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=1;exitY=0.5207;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="listeners" target="c1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e-c1-d" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5207;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c1" target="save"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;하루 묶음 알림 1종&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;판매자·날짜마다 강의 지급" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="316" width="210" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-l-c2" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=1;exitY=0.8802;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="listeners" target="c2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e-c2-d" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.8802;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="save"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c-cap" value="종류마다 문구 템플릿" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;text;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#64748B;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="380" width="210" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="save" value="" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="132" width="380" height="242" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lock" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;① 받는 사람 행 잠금&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#64748B&quot;&gt;SELECT … FOR UPDATE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;같은 받는 사람의 저장만 줄을 선다" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="716" y="148" width="348" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="keep" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;② 알림 저장, 최신 20개만 남김&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;21번째부터 Soft Delete" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="716" y="226" width="348" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="commit" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;COMMIT&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color:#64748B&quot;&gt;PostgreSQL, schema notification&lt;/span&gt;" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="716" y="304" width="348" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-lock-keep" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lock" target="keep"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e-keep-commit" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="keep" target="commit"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="queue" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;메모리 큐&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;최대 1,000건&lt;br&gt;넣기만 하고 기다리지 않음" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#8B5CF6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="548" width="184" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="worker" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;발행 스레드 1개&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;최대 100건씩 꺼내&lt;br&gt;DB를 한 번에 읽고 발행" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#F5F3FF;strokeColor=#8B5CF6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="224" y="548" width="184" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="redis" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;Redis Pub/Sub&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;각 서버가 구독해&lt;br&gt;자기 연결로 넘긴다" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="448" y="548" width="184" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="stomp" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;STOMP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;/user/queue/notifications" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="672" y="548" width="184" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="browser" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px&quot;&gt;브라우저&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;알림과 안 읽은 수를&lt;br&gt;바로 갱신" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;rounded=1;arcSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1F2937;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="896" y="548" width="184" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-queue-worker" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#8B5CF6;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="queue" target="worker"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e-worker-redis" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#8B5CF6;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="worker" target="redis"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e-redis-stomp" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="redis" target="stomp"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e-stomp-browser" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="stomp" target="browser"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="queue-cap" value="차면 버린다, 저장은 그대로" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;text;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#B91C1C;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="650" width="184" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="worker-cap" value="발행 실패 뒤 5초는 건너뜀" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;text;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;fontSize=13;fontColor=#64748B;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="224" y="650" width="184" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-commit-queue" value="커밋 뒤에만" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#8B5CF6;strokeWidth=2;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;fontSize=13;fontColor=#8B5CF6;labelBackgroundColor=#F3F3F3;exitX=0.1579;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="save" target="queue"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="760" y="520"/><mxPoint x="92.0" y="520"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e-rest" value="REST로 맞춤&lt;br&gt;목록·안 읽은 수" style="html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=5;fontFamily=Wanted Sans;fontSize=13;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#F3F3F3